# SHELL_ENABLED=
# Extra environment variable names to forward into shell_exec child processes,
# comma-separated. The child environment is default-DENY: it receives only a
# small allowlist (PATH, HOME, locale, toolchain and proxy vars) so a
# model-authored command can never read this process's API keys or bot tokens.
# Use this only when a build genuinely needs one more variable.
#   SHELL_EXEC_ENV_PASSTHROUGH=MY_REGISTRY_TOKEN,ARTIFACTORY_URL
# SHELL_EXEC_ENV_PASSTHROUGH=
# Force the vault file watcher into stat-polling mode with this interval (ms).
# Default is 0 = native filesystem events. Polling stat()s every watched file on
# every tick — roughly a quarter of a CPU core on an idle 10k-file tree — so set
# this only where native events genuinely do not work (some network filesystems
# and container bind-mounts).
# VAULT_WATCH_POLL_INTERVAL_MS=
# STRADA_AGENT_NAME=
# STRADA_CHECKLIST_AFTERNOON_HOUR=
# STRADA_CHECKLIST_EVENING_HOUR=
# STRADA_CHECKLIST_MORNING_HOUR=
# STRADA_CONFIDENCE_WEIGHTS=
# STRADA_CONFORMANCE_ENABLED=
# STRADA_CONFORMANCE_FRAMEWORK_PATHS_ONLY=
# STRADA_DETECTION_WINDOW_SIZE=
# STRADA_DIGEST_ENABLED=
# STRADA_DIGEST_SCHEDULE=
# STRADA_LOOP_DENSITY_THRESHOLD=
# STRADA_LOOP_DENSITY_WINDOW=
